Subject: [PATCH 2/4] [test] Cover mask facts across a dominating merge

Keep a diamond merge large enough to prevent block cloning, and verify
that a mask guard before the diamond eliminates an implied guard in the
merge. Assert that the merge and its common dominator remain distinct.

TAG=agy
CONV=01a15ac7-b7fe-7dc2-ab61-5d14a81b88b5
